---
source: crates/lazy-github/src/main.rs
expression: "Cli::command().render_help().to_string()"
---
A terminal UI for GitHub

Usage: lazy-github [COMMAND]

Commands:
  clear-auth    Explains how to log out: LazyGithub uses the GitHub CLI's login
  clear-cache   Reset the lazy-github cache
  clear-config  Reset the user's settings
  debug         Outputs LazyGithub debug info
  dump-config   Dump the current configuration, as it would be loaded by LazyGithub
  run           Run LazyGithub
  version       Prints the current version
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
